ToolTip Fix (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "ToolTipFix" by kyrptonaught
(https://github.com/kyrptonaught/tooltipfix, MIT license).

Original mod (Minecraft 1.21.1 and earlier, Fabric):
- Modrinth: https://modrinth.com/mod/tooltipfix
- Source: https://github.com/kyrptonaught/tooltipfix

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
kyrptonaught. This port was created by Itamio to bring the functionality to
Minecraft 26.3 because the original mod has not been updated to this
version.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was self-updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric,
Mojang mappings). The original MIT license (Copyright (c) 2019 kyrptonaught)
is preserved in the LICENSE file.
